1.explanation:
Both of these modules are responsible for exporting the Data-related components to consumers. Right now, neither file mentions or re-exports a `DataTableGroup` component, so that component can’t be imported or used. To add `DataTableGroup`, you would implement it (e.g. in src/js/components/Data/DataTableGroup.js) and then update:

• src/js/components/Data/index.js to export { DataTableGroup } from './DataTableGroup';
• src/js/components/index.js    to export * from './DataTableGroup';

This ensures the new component is part of the library’s public API.
